msgstr "NAMN"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "fmt - simple optimal text formatter"
msgstr "fmt — enkel optimal textformaterare"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr "SYNOPSIS"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "B<fmt> [I<\\,-WIDTH\\/>] [I<\\,OPTION\\/>]... [I<\\,FILE\\/>]..."
msgstr "B<fmt> [I<\\,-BREDD\\/>] [I<\\,FLAGGA\\/>]... [I<\\,FIL\\/>]..."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "BESKRIVNING"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Reformat each paragraph in the FILE(s), writing to standard output.  The "
"option B<-WIDTH> is an abbreviated form of B<--width>=I<\\,DIGITS\\/>."
msgstr ""
"Formatera om varje stycke i FILen/-erna, skriv till standard ut.Flaggan B<-"
"BREDD> är en förkortad form av B<--width>=I<\\,SIFFROR\\/>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "With no FILE, or when FILE is -, read standard input."
msgstr "Utan FIL, eller när FIL är -, läs standard in."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Mandatory arguments to long options are mandatory for short options too."
msgstr ""
"Obligatoriska argument till långa flaggor är obligatoriska även för de korta."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-c>, B<--crown-margin>"
msgstr "B<-c>, B<--crown-margin>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "preserve indentation of first two lines"
msgstr "Bibehåll indragning av de två första raderna."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-p>, B<--prefix>=I<\\,STRING\\/>"
msgstr "B<-p>, B<--prefix>=I<\\,STRÄNG\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"reformat only lines beginning with STRING, reattaching the prefix to "
"reformatted lines"
msgstr ""
"Formatera bara om rader som börjar med STRÄNG sätt tillbaka prefixet på "
"omformaterade rader."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-s>, B<--split-only>"
msgstr "B<-s>, B<--split-only>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "split long lines, but do not refill"
msgstr "Dela långa rader, men justera ej."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-t>, B<--tagged-paragraph>"
msgstr "B<-t>, B<--tagged-paragraph>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "indentation of first line different from second"
msgstr "Indrag av första raden inte samma som andra raden."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-u>, B<--uniform-spacing>"
msgstr "B<-u>, B<--uniform-spacing>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "one space between words, two after sentences"
msgstr "Ett mellanslag mellan ord, två efter meningar."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-w>, B<--width>=I<\\,WIDTH\\/>"
msgstr "B<-w>, B<--width>=I<\\,ANTAL\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "maximum line width (default of 75 columns)"
msgstr "Maximal radlängd (standardvärde 75 kolumner)."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-g>, B<--goal>=I<\\,WIDTH\\/>"
msgstr "B<-g>, B<--goal>=I<\\,LÄNGD\\/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "goal width (default of 93% of width)"
msgstr "Målradlängd (standard är 93 % av bredden)."

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--help>"
msgstr "B<--help>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "display this help and exit"
msgstr "visa denna hjälp och avsluta"

#. type: TP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--version>"
msgstr "B<--version>"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "output version information and exit"
msgstr "visa versionsinformation och avsluta"

